---
const facts = [
  { k: 'role', v: 'Team Lead · Senior Software Engineer', note: 'Pixonal' },
  { k: 'also', v: 'Forward Deployed Engineer', note: 'UAE government clients' },
  { k: 'based', v: 'Cairo ⇄ Dubai', note: 'Hybrid, travels on-site' },
  { k: 'next', v: 'AZ-104 Azure Administrator', note: 'In progress' },
];
---

<section id="getting-started" class="section" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
    <p class="crumb">docs / <b>getting-started</b></p>
    <h2 id="about-title" class="section-title">Getting started</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">A quick install guide for working with me.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-copy">
      <div class="install card" data-reveal>
        <div class="install-head mono">
          <span>terminal</span>
          <button class="copy-cmd" data-copy="bun add ahmed-samak" aria-label="Copy install command">copy</button>
        </div>
        <pre class="mono"><span class="ps">$</span> bun add ahmed-samak
<span class="ok">+ ahmed-samak@6.0.0</span>
<span class="dim">  installed 5 modules: web, graphics, native, medical, games</span>
<span class="dim">  0 vulnerabilities · 6+ years of patches</span></pre>
      </div>

      <div class="prose" data-reveal>
        <!-- One line per paragraph: line breaks next to inline tags get collapsed at build time. -->
        <p>I'm Ahmed, a software engineer who never picked just one lane. I started out making <strong>educational web games</strong>, moved into real-time 3D with <strong>Unreal Engine</strong>, spent nearly three years writing <strong>Modern C++ for FDA-approved surgical software</strong>, and now lead a team at <strong>Pixonal</strong> building Llumen, a decision intelligence platform for government leaders in the UAE.</p>
        <p>Day to day I own Llumen's graphics: every map, chart, and 2D or 3D visual that turns data into decisions. I also work as a <strong>Forward Deployed Engineer</strong>, travelling to client sites to get the platform running on anything from Azure Kubernetes clusters to servers with no internet at all.</p>
        <p>The common thread: I like hard performance problems, clean architecture, and software people actually enjoy using.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="side">
      <figure class="portrait tilt" data-reveal>
        <picture>
          <source srcset="/me-320.webp 320w, /me-640.webp 640w" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 340px, 90vw" type="image/webp" />
          <img src="/me.jpg" alt="Portrait of Ahmed Samak smiling outdoors" width="640" height="640" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        </picture>
        <figcaption class="mono"><span class="pulse-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> ahmed.samak · online</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <dl class="facts">
        {
          facts.map((f) => (
            <div class="fact card" data-reveal>
              <dt class="mono">{f.k}</dt>
              <dd>
                <span class="fact-v">{f.v}</span>
                <span class="fact-n">{f.note}</span>
              </dd>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); /* lets the <pre> scroll instead of widening the page */
    gap: 28px;
  }
  .install {
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .install-head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 8px 14px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--faint);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface-2);
  }
  .copy-cmd {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    min-height: 28px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .copy-cmd:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  .install pre {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 16px;
    font-size: clamp(0.74rem, 1.8vw, 0.86rem);
    line-height: 1.8;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .ps {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .ok {
    color: #22c55e;
  }
  :global(html[data-theme='light']) .ok {
    color: #15803d;
  }
  .dim {
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .prose {
    display: grid;
    gap: 16px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
  .prose strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .side {
    display: grid;
    gap: 16px;
    align-content: start;
  }
  .portrait {
    position: relative;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 360px;
    width: 100%;
    justify-self: center;
    padding: 4px;
    border-radius: 22px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--c-web), var(--c-gfx) 55%, var(--c-game));
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px -24px color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 60%, transparent);
  }
  .portrait img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: var(--surface-2);
  }
  .portrait figcaption {
    position: absolute;
    left: 16px;
    bottom: 16px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: #e7eaf0;
    background: rgba(8, 10, 14, 0.7);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  }
  .pulse-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #22c55e;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.25);
  }
  .facts {
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 0;
    align-content: start;
  }
  .fact {
    padding: 16px 18px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 64px 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: baseline;
    transition: border-color 0.3s, transform 0.3s var(--ease-out);
  }
  .fact:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }
  .fact dt {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .fact dd {
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
  }
  .fact-v {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .fact-n {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.4fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 40px;
    }
  }
</style>
